    "slug": "best-portable-speaker-under-100-in-2026-us-and-canada",
    "title": "Best Portable Speaker Under $100 in 2026 (US & Canada)",
    "description": "Portable Bluetooth speakers under $100 ranked by long-term satisfaction. Owner data for North America.",
